  "sourceFindings": [
    "Human male with short tousled black hair and vivid magenta front streak, warm skin and uncovered face.",
    "Dark charcoal/plum workshop coat and long split apron panels with red/coral lozenge motifs, metal shoulder plates, pale ivory forearm wraps, belt tools and dark boots.",
    "Broad flat dark blade with luminous coral edge, repeated lozenge engraving and geometrical metal cross guard; source is not a coral crystal sword.",
    "Lore establishes threshold-workshop maintenance, engraved maker names, witness protection and restoring individual names erased from RouteX. No immutable handedness established."
  ],
